LICENSE - NOT YET FINALIZED
============================

This repository does not yet have a finalized open-source license.

No license decision was found in the private repository this project
was exported from, and per this export's own instructions, a license
choice is not something to be decided unilaterally as part of an
automated export process.

Until this file is replaced with an actual license text:

  - Do NOT treat this repository as available for reuse, redistribution,
    or modification under any implied license.
  - All rights are reserved by the copyright holder by default.

See docs/PUBLIC_RELEASE_ACCEPTANCE.md for the status of this decision
and what needs to happen before this repository is actually published.

Recommended next step for the maintainer: choose a license appropriate
for an open-source security research tool (common choices for this kind
of project include MIT, Apache-2.0, or GPL-3.0-or-later depending on
your goals for downstream use/attribution/copyleft) and replace this
file with its full text before making this repository public.
